---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<div class="dc-section">
  <div class="dc-section__inner dc-tldr-banner">
    <span class="dc-tldr-badge">TL;DR — Be Nice.</span>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;max-width:44ch">The long version matters too. Read it before you come — it takes two minutes, and it's the same for organisers, sponsors and everyone else.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="dc-section">
  <div class="dc-section__inner">
    <div class="dc-grid dc-grid--2">
      <div>
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:var(--text-heading)">Consent, always</h3>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5">Ask before photographing anyone. Be mindful of yellow lanyards — they mean "please don't put me in pictures".</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:var(--text-heading)">Room Q is the quiet room</h3>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5">No sessions, no small talk, no explaining yourself. Use it whenever you need it.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:var(--text-heading)">Challenge ideas, not people</h3>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5">Disagreement is why we're here. Do it in a way that keeps the other person in the conversation.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:var(--text-heading)">If something's wrong, tell us</h3>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5">Find any organiser — we're the ones covered in rocket stickers — or email <a href="mailto:info@delivercon.uk">info@delivercon.uk</a>. We will act on it the same day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-tile" style="grid-column:1 / -1;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:20px">
        <span aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:36px">🏢</span>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5">It's a working government building: please be respectful of the space, stay in the areas we've booked, and if there is an alarm, disperse from the building and gather at the muster point on Peasholme Green.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="dc-section">
  <div class="dc-section__inner dc-prose" style="max-width:820px">
    <h2>The full code of conduct</h2>
    {{ content | safe }}
  </div>
</div>
